    {
      "parameters": {
        "language": "python",
        "pythonCode": "import json\n\noutput = _input.all()[0].json.output\njson_output = json.loads(output)\n\nid = 0\nfor j in json_output:\n  j['id'] = id   \n  j['preferred'] = 0\n  id += 1\n\n\nreturn {'json_output': json_output}"
      },
      "id": "8b70a862-0b84-4cde-92a6-537c278ab670",
      "name": "Code1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -1500,
        -1480
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "assistant",
        "assistantId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={{ $json.assistant_id }}",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "prompt": "define",
        "text": "=Generate six versions of hyper-realistic portrait prompts for the following buyer persona description:\n\n{{ $json.preferred_buyer_person_details }}\n\n\nGuidelines for the prompts:\n\n- Begin each prompt description with “Photo of a”.\n- Write the prompts in English.\n- Take this list as an example format for reference:\n\nExample 1. photo of a 27-year-old man with a determined expression, standing confidently amidst the bustling cityscape of Mexico City. He holds a credit card , symbolizing his first step towards financial independence. The vibrant city lights and dynamic architecture reflect his ambition and drive.\n\nExample 2. Photo of a 25-year-old woman, with a happy expression, confidently navigating the bustling streets of Miami vibrant city center. She holds a smartphone symbolizing her journey towards financial independence.\n\nExample 3. Photo of a middle-aged African American man with glasses and a casual shirt, standing in an urban setting at dusk.\n\nExample 4. Photo of a 35-year-old man with short brown hair and a beard, wearing a formal suit, sitting in a studio with soft lighting.\n\nExample 5. Photo of a young woman with curly hair, wearing a summer dress, with the sea visible in the background.\n\nUse Temperature 0.9 for creative variations.\n\n\nThe output is a correct formed JSON array that contains the generated elements, each one of then must replicate this structure\n\n{\n      \"description\": \"Photo of a 28-year-old woman with a serene expression, working from home in her urban apartment’s modern, well-organized office space.\"\n}\n\nPlease, omit any introductory comment previously to the answer, go directly to the output, and remove from response json tag.",
        "options": {}
      },
